  "title": "Khadija bint Khuwaylid",
  "summary": "Khadija was a wealthy merchant of Mecca from the Quraysh. Around 595 she married Muhammad after he led a trading caravan for her to Syria. After his first revelation, about 610, she was the first to accept his mission and supported him through Meccan hostility. She died in Mecca around 619.",
